  "description": "The OXVA Xlim Go Vape Kit is a compact yet powerful vape device that caters to vapers of all experience levels. With its sleek design and versatile features, this vape kit is sure to impress any vaper that is looking for a powerful yet compact device with long battery life and customisation features. Powered by a built-in 1000mAh battery, the Xlim Go delivers up to 30W of output power , ensuring a satisfying vaping experience that lasts. Whether you prefer a mouth-to-lung (MTL) or restricted direct-lung (RDL) inhale, this vape kit has got you covered. Featuring convenient fixed-coil pods, the Xlim Go offers hassle-free vaping. Simply fill the pod through the side-refill port, attach it to the device, and wait a few minutes for the e-liquid to saturate the coil. Then, inhale on the mouthpiece and enjoy smooth and flavourful clouds of vapour. The adjustable airflow control allows you to customise your inhale, creating either an airy or restricted draw depending on your preference. This level of customisation ensures that every vaper can find their perfect vaping style with ease. Crafted from a combination of plastic, artificial leather, and PCTG materials, the Xlim Go is not only durable but also aesthetically pleasing. Its slim and lightweight design makes it highly portable, perfect for on-the-go vaping. With its compatibility with Xlim Top Fill pods and various resistances (0.4ohm, 0.6ohm, 0.8ohm, and 1.2ohm), you have the freedom to choose from a wide range of e-liquids to suit your taste preferences. Upgrade your vaping experience with the OXVA Xlim Go Vape Kit. Get yours today and enjoy a satisfying and personalised vaping journey. We Recommend paring the kit with 50/50 , Nic Salt or High PG E-Liquid Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. How to set up the Oxva Xlim Go Pod Kit",
